an lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">19 </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">확산     추세가 지속됨에 따라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2020</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">년 동해 송정동유적 발굴</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">20</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">주년 기념을 맞이하여 준비한 특별전 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">영동지역 최대 철기시대마을</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&gt;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">을 </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">온라인 전시로 대체하여 운영</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">하고자 하오니 많은 시민 및 학생들이 이용할 수     있도록 홍보하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.